cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: amenbo
abstract: >-
  A Japanese-web-native MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for low-impact,
  token-efficient web collection. Outline-to-section progressive disclosure and
  diff-only refetches keep agent context small, while robots.txt-aware,
  rate-limited two-tier fetching keeps load on target sites low. Handles
  loosely structured Japanese pages, legacy encodings, ruby annotations,
  image-rendered information, and tables dropped by generic content extraction.
type: software
authors:
